190	     * none;</li>
191	     * <li>{@code <option>}s that are disabled, or that are within a disabled {@code <optgroup>}, are not eligible;</li>
192	     * <li>checkboxes and radio buttons are only included when checked;</li>
193	     * <li>{@code <input>} elements of type {@code button} and {@code image}, and {@code <button>} elements, are not
194	     * submitted; other input types (including {@code submit} and {@code reset}) are included as before.</li>
195	     * </ul>
196	     @return a fresh, independent list of key vals
197	     */
